WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. Open Enrollment CRM → Leads and confirm the school and exact prospective family.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.213
Step 2. Review existing contact information, child age/program interest and prior follow-up before adding another lead.

00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:27.916
Step 3. Use Pipeline, Tours or Waitlist for the next school-approved step; record the actual status rather than an assumed milestone.

00:00:27.916 --> 00:00:37.529
Step 4. When an enrollment packet is needed, select the lead and use Send registration form. Review the recipient before sending.

00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:46.529
Step 5. Once the saved family, guardian and child are verified, use the separate parent invitation workflow.

00:00:46.529 --> 00:00:55.529
Step 6. Confirm the next follow-up owner and date; verify enrollment and classroom state in the child record.

00:00:55.529 --> 00:01:04.529
Verify the result. Lead follow-up, registration, enrollment and parent access have distinct verified states.

